# Paths skipped by ripgrep-based search (Claude Code Grep/Glob, VS Code search).
# Git, the build and the website are not affected; files can still be opened by
# path. Folder-specific rules live in a .ignore inside each folder, so they
# apply whichever folder a search starts from:
#   www/plugins/      third-party libraries (Font Awesome alone ~190 MB)
#   www/downloads/    www/pdf/    deploy/sample-images/   binary assets
#   app/database/     *.sql dumps (long INSERT lines, copies of templates)

*.min.js
*.min.css
*.map
